{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "原本係江勝觀居士親校之刻本。分二十卷。茲合為一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性、心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今河南上蔡縣東。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛制僧律。常以四月半至七月半，結夏安居。期滿。解制。是為夏\n竟。歲歲如此。故以一夏為一歲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓十住位。此位即可分身作佛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓教十信。即六根清淨位。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行者若欲修之，當於下止觀體狀文中學。若有所疑不決，然後徧讀，當有斷疑之處也。又此所明，悉依經論。其中多有經文論偈。不得不淨御之，恐招無敬之罪。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即序分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即正宗分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即流通分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷一竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷二竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "修之而成自受用報身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "報，指他受用身。應即勝劣二身，及隨類化身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指妙極法身。即果頭法身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指清淨法身。即在纏法身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "變，即隨緣之義。非其性體有變也。此理須認清。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無明，為三毒中之癡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "子時無明，與下文果時無明，此二名，本於天親菩薩《十地經論》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "書中用及以二字括之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "識陰中，六七二識力用最大。故本書似識二字，專約此二識為言。受想行為徧行心所。六七識起時，相應俱起。故本文雖但舉六七識，而受想行已包在內。其餘觸作意\n等心所。以本文但舉五陰，姑略之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "意根攝入識內。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眼耳鼻舌身五識也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "等者，等於似塵。不了，即果時無明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即下文之妄想也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即下文之妄境界。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "由此似識念念起時，至以為實事。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下科更詳言之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上文云，似識妄執之義，即是妄想是也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "似塵兼似色言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解已\n見前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是住地無明。地指心言。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解成，即是觀行覺成就。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不執，即我空。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "業障。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "苦障。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "果無明滅，為小乘初果位，大乘圓初信位。妄想妄境滅，為小乘羅漢位，大乘圓二信至十信位。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "知即是覺，若不知即不覺矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又名迷心無明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即子時無明，言其細於果時無明也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即界內之通惑。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無明住地也。亦即子時無明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即果時無明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "習氣未除，即是覺相微也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即見思細惑。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是觀行位一念創始發修之時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即相似位也。一\n名六根清淨位。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷三竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十住，十行，十回向，十地，加等覺，共四十一位。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《彌陀經》所明七\n寶樓臺行樹等，尚是凡聖同居土境界。實報莊嚴，倍復過之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即轉成金\n剛無礙智之後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即第八識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓教位次，一位攝一切位。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此位\n為轉凡入聖之樞機。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至此則超凡入聖矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即妙覺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覺心即是佛性。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如如是平等義。此性出纏，即清淨法身也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天，人，\n地獄，餓鬼，畜生，為五道。按五道六道，諸經開合不同。開則加阿修羅，曰六道。合則攝修羅於天道或鬼道。見唯識樞要。又《法華文句》云：修羅有二種。鬼道攝者，居大海邊，畜生道攝者，居大海底。則可攝於鬼畜二\n道也。故祇曰五道。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻由觀行進修，而至究竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛造眾生，如隨類應現，廣度羣品是也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷四竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以其俱名阿黎耶，是專就三細說故也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不一不異，為真實性故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起信論本約真如明二藏。今故以二種如來藏轉辨真如。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即非有現有之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即能分別者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即所\n分別者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷五竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妄境。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妄想。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按有即非有句，即具含不一不異，空不空等句\n之理。蓋諸法緣念，同一虛妄。原非淨心之所本有。但由心動，不無虛相顯現。實則有即非有。夫一有一非有，不一也。有即非有不異也。又有即非有，是空義。非有而有，是不空義。故下二科文，皆由此句開出耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如以指指月，非認指\n為月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此如煑砂成飯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此如揚湯止沸。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "猶言泯用入體。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兼地水火風言之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切人物。皆是四大幻有。粟麥亦然。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文中法字。即指前無\n明言。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文中熏他令起之他字，即指後念無明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即後麥子。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是後麥子。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是前麥子。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即指無明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即業識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一向者，一方面\n也。謂由起之義，乃約一方面為言。如曰不覺故動等，皆就不覺方面，以明生起之由是也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "約有無論，可交互說。不同由起，只能約一面說。又文中雖無，若無業識即無無明兩\n句。然據下明果時無明之文，例知應有。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷六竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常樂我淨，\n為佛果四德。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即不改意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即染業與淨性，淨業與染性，應云相違是也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即淨性起淨業，染性起染業，應云相順是也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即染用也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如觀世音等諸大菩\n薩，位鄰於佛。即與佛無異也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷七竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "理、事、理事、事事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四聖、六凡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詳後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "旁生者畜生也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "化生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "帖與貼通。附益之義。舉火喻附鏡喻。益足以反顯鏡具像性之理。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原\n本卷八竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華嚴之異名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即真如在障意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "泥洹即涅槃。不生不滅之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真源者。所謂覺心源故，名究竟覺是也。實際者。實際理地也。皆自性清淨心之\n異名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即界內，禪定。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨類應現，神化殊妙。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓融，即平等義。能所，即差別義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷九竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "集合也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即八識\n之相分。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所治之法，乃指事言也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷十竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即共一如\n來藏之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法界法爾，即心性天然之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見上二明受報不同，及初釋凡聖同時受報疑文中。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即第八識。本書又名\n為本識。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即體相之相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原\n本卷十一竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言非如前五塵，各有所表現。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云不廢者，不已之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "土灰\n眾色，指遷化言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "末那，梵語翻為意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "轉意識成妙觀察智。轉末那成平等性智。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是解性增已"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即無塵智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即淨心。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如下止觀體狀中所明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷十二竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本書或約體而舉淨心。或約相而說本識。\n\n以體相不離，所以隨文顯義，不必限用一名。今將辨明依止之體，故言淨心不言本識也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依止者，歸著之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此中雖單舉寂，實亦兼照。觀下文云：但息於念，心即寂照。例此可知。\n何以故？淨心之體，即寂即照，從來無二故。但因文便，故單約本寂為言耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻上文不覺自動。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻上文顯現諸相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即約下句念不起之意破\n也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即約上句不作心念破也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "財、色、食、名、睡，為五欲也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按位登初住以上之菩薩，為分證真如三昧。若心體寂照體證真如，乃是佛位。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷十三竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文中違用即是染用。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開之為自受用報身，他受用報身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "列表附後以便省覽。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觸，謂冷熱、飢飽、輕重、澁滑等。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又前五識起時，各與意識俱起，隨念計度分別。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "執第八識之見分，以為實我。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受前七識業力之熏，而成種子。即復執持種子，現作根身（正報）器界（依報）。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此五心所，有善惡之別。因其一切心中俱得生起，故曰徧行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此五心所，亦有邪正之分。因其各別緣境而生，故曰別境。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此十一心所，唯善心中得生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此六心所，惱亂有情，能生其他煩惱，故名根本煩惱也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此二十心所，由\n根本煩惱引起，故曰隨煩惱。又分三類，前十為小隨，各別起故；中二無慚無愧，為中隨，唯徧不善故；後八為大隨，自類俱生，徧染心故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此四心所，善染不定。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "貪、瞋、癡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "貪、癡、慢、邪見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷十四竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如下斷得中所明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久，鳴尺一下云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其異無別有句，下第二重止觀中遣之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鳴尺一下云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久，復鳴尺一下云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷十五竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無相性，是不執虛為實。無相解脫，是不執虛相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一名無願\n亦名無起。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "體謂三性當體。非體相用之體也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即在染之真。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輪義見前。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即機感也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此眾生之淨心也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷十六竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常者，不遷不變。樂者，安隱寂滅。我者，自在無礙。淨者，離垢無染。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即自受用"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即他受用"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如始自王宮降生。終\n至雙樹現滅是也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "果時無明，即迷事無明。亦名迷境無明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷十七竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見第一大科三明佛性中，\n二出名相，及初明別惑之相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即子時無明也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一相，即一向也。猶言一直。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即十住也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "地前，即是十住十行十迴向。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三界見惑，名見一切處住地。欲界思惑，名欲愛住地。色界思惑，名色愛住地。無色界思惑，名有\n愛住地。塵沙，無明，合名無明住地。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見四教儀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "小乘教義\n託胎住胎不別開，合為一相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "忉利，華言三十三天。即帝釋所居。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夜摩，華言善時分，謂時時快樂也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兜率，華言知足，謂於五欲知止足也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂諸樂境，皆由他化，而自在受用也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四雙八隻也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷十八竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於生滅之身，受，\n心，法起淨，樂，常，我想，為凡夫四倒。於無生無滅之常樂我淨，起無常等想，為二乘四倒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或單曰偈，或單言頌。其義一也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷十九竟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杭州海潮寺大殿西，首一尊，即梵王像。色相殊妙。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從心所作，所字衍。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【校】上來原本卷二十竟。"}
